I go to the shopkeeper.
I have three new garments in my hand.
A big blue kurta, a white shirt, and a big red scarf.
I put those clothes on the counter.
I speak to the shopkeeper.
"Bhaiya, these clothes are very good."
"What is the total price?"
The shopkeeper looks at the clothes and calculates the price.
He says, "Madam, the total price is two thousand rupees."
I take out money from my bag.
I give two thousand rupees to him.
He accepts the money.
He gives the new clothes to me.
I put the big blue kurta in my bag.
I put the white shirt and the big red scarf in the bag.
I am very happy.
Tomorrow at the office, I will wear this big blue kurta.
